{"title":"Anvil/28","sourceTitle":"Anvil/28/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Uma bigorna pode ser usada para trabalhar a camada do metal correspondente e 1 camada acima, junto com todas as camadas abaixo. A única exceção é <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meteoric iron\">meteoric iron</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Meteoric iron\"> </a></span>, que requer uma bigorna <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Iron\">iron</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron\" title=\"Iron\"> </a></span> para funcionar em vez de uma bigorna <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bronze\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span>. Os metais sem camadas têm vários requisitos de bigorna, conforme mostrado na tabela abaixo.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115620\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 417/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 138/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.380      1 -total\n 95.51%    1.318      3 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183575-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115620 and revision id 397193. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397193,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Anvil%2F28%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T11:56:21.249Z"}